WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:38.645 --> 00:01:43.173
You're completely surrounded!
Come out peacefully!

00:01:57.164 --> 00:02:00.567
Shame on you guys... You're are all talk!

00:02:00.567 --> 00:02:02.728
We're out of here, people!

00:02:08.308 --> 00:02:10.572
Sorry I kept you waiting, Hotsuma!

00:02:34.201 --> 00:02:37.337
What do you think?
When the space pirate Ryoko starts

00:02:37.337 --> 00:02:39.139
to go all-out, this is what happens.

00:02:39.139 --> 00:02:40.907
I knew you could do it, Ryoko.

00:02:40.907 --> 00:02:44.277
These henchmen you hired
didn't do too bad at all, either.

00:02:44.277 --> 00:02:48.008
Okay, let's head back to
the hideout and live it up!

00:02:50.584 --> 00:02:53.820
Party! Party!

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.288
Hey, Mihoshi!

00:02:55.288 --> 00:02:57.290
Don't be so happy about it!

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:00.193
I'm sorry, Kiyone...

00:03:00.193 --> 00:03:04.357
Ryoko, I can't believe the day would
come when I'd arrest you personally...

00:03:20.814 --> 00:03:24.682
Okay, thirty minutes left,
people! Time to hunker down!

00:03:28.088 --> 00:03:30.181
I... I just don't get this.

00:03:34.461 --> 00:03:37.157
So there are cicadas here in Tokyo, too...

00:03:41.001 --> 00:03:42.435
Okay, time's up.

00:03:42.435 --> 00:03:44.960
You people in back,
collect the answer sheets.

00:03:47.774 --> 00:03:49.009
It's over!

00:03:49.009 --> 00:03:51.778
How'd you do, genius?

00:03:51.778 --> 00:03:53.713
Not bad, I guess.
How about you, Amagasaki?

00:03:53.713 --> 00:03:56.341
I aced it, of course...

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:58.351
How'd you do, Masaki?

00:03:58.351 --> 00:04:00.153
Not too bad.

00:04:00.153 --> 00:04:03.390
Looks like Amagasaki and I are
gonna be taking our usual makeup tests...

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:04.324
Be seeing you...

00:04:04.324 --> 00:04:07.594
What am I gonna do? Maybe I failed, too.

00:04:07.594 --> 00:04:09.563
Maybe it's time to face facts...

00:04:09.563 --> 00:04:11.364
It's over, Tenchi!

00:04:11.364 --> 00:04:12.666
How'd you do, Sakuya?

00:04:12.666 --> 00:04:13.667
Not bad, I guess.

00:04:13.667 --> 00:04:15.535
Aw, puke...

00:04:15.535 --> 00:04:17.137
These gifted couples sure have it easy...

00:04:17.137 --> 00:04:19.005
I just did okay, all right?

00:04:19.005 --> 00:04:21.808
We didn't ace it or anything.

00:04:21.808 --> 00:04:23.469
- Right?
- Right?

00:04:24.344 --> 00:04:26.947
Well, it's over, so what's done is done.

00:04:26.947 --> 00:04:31.284
Hey, Masaki, finals are over, so do
you wanna go someplace with us?

00:04:31.284 --> 00:04:32.118
"Someplace"?

00:04:32.118 --> 00:04:35.755
It's summer vacation, right?
We should all go somewhere.

00:04:35.755 --> 00:04:36.656
A trip, huh?

00:04:36.656 --> 00:04:38.592
- That sounds great...
- Where should we go?

00:04:38.592 --> 00:04:40.226
You wanna come, too?

00:04:40.226 --> 00:04:44.264
Talk about insensitive...
Masaki's going, so we are, too.

00:04:44.264 --> 00:04:45.788
Right, Sakuya?

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:47.634
Sure.

00:04:47.634 --> 00:04:51.171
Okay, then, Masaki, you
pick where we're gonna go.

00:04:51.171 --> 00:04:52.305
Me?

00:04:52.305 --> 00:04:54.808
This is your first summer vacation
since coming to Tokyo, right?

00:04:54.808 --> 00:04:56.476
Pick anywhere you like.

00:04:56.476 --> 00:04:59.346
I'd feel safer with someplace
that you picked, anyway.

00:04:59.346 --> 00:05:01.715
- What's that supposed to mean?!
- What do you think?

00:05:01.715 --> 00:05:03.483
Okay, where's it gonna be, Masaki?

00:05:03.483 --> 00:05:04.551
Masaki!

00:05:04.551 --> 00:05:05.952
- Let me think...
- Come on, come on!

00:05:05.952 --> 00:05:09.155
- Masaki!
- Hurry it up!

00:05:09.155 --> 00:05:15.095
It's strange... All of a sudden,
everybody's revolving around Tenchi.

00:05:15.095 --> 00:05:18.131
It's finally here! Summer vacation!

00:05:18.131 --> 00:05:22.067
Go ahead and forget
about school and go live it up!

00:05:43.023 --> 00:05:46.426
Yeah, booze tastes best when
you're drinking with a crowd!

00:05:46.426 --> 00:05:51.261
Come on, people! Drink up!
Nobody's standing on ceremony today!

00:05:52.032 --> 00:05:54.601
Come on, Hotsuma! You have some, too!

00:05:54.601 --> 00:05:58.038
From now on, the two of us can
do whatever we want, just like this.

00:05:58.038 --> 00:05:59.665
Together.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.267
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:06.012 --> 00:06:09.082
A hundred henchmen and a
secret underground hideout...

00:06:09.082 --> 00:06:11.151
It's just like that tip said...

00:06:11.151 --> 00:06:14.177
All we have to do now is
contact Galaxy Police headquarters.

00:06:15.121 --> 00:06:18.420
I'll get that promotion I've only
dreamed about! That promotion!

00:06:20.827 --> 00:06:23.096
Damn, I almost blew it...

00:06:23.096 --> 00:06:25.865
Okay, let's contact HQ right away, Mihoshi.

00:06:25.865 --> 00:06:26.599
Mihoshi?

00:06:26.599 --> 00:06:28.868
Hey, Mihoshi! Where'd she...

00:06:28.868 --> 00:06:35.041
Hey! Here's a Galaxy Police work song!

00:06:35.041 --> 00:06:38.011
You moron!

00:06:38.011 --> 00:06:40.180
Do you have any idea what you're doing?

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:41.915
Of course!

00:06:41.915 --> 00:06:46.186
I'm a henchman of the space pirate
Ryoko, whose name scares children!

00:06:46.186 --> 00:06:49.689
Wrong! We're Galaxy Police detectives!

00:06:49.689 --> 00:06:51.791
Detect...

00:06:51.791 --> 00:06:55.090
De... Yay!

00:06:56.529 --> 00:07:00.667
We're gonna contact HQ and ask them
to send in Special Investigations, right?

00:07:00.667 --> 00:07:03.136
L-I can't breathe, Kiyone!

00:07:03.136 --> 00:07:08.508
So until they get to this hideout,
we have to stall Ryoko and her gang!

00:07:08.508 --> 00:07:10.143
I udderztand...

00:07:10.143 --> 00:07:12.112
Good.

00:07:12.112 --> 00:07:16.549
Darn it, Kiyone, you're
even more serious than usual...

00:07:16.549 --> 00:07:20.120
If we can pull off this mission,
we'll be promoted for sure!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:24.113
Returning to HQ, nothing!
We might even make Chief Detective!

00:07:31.531 --> 00:07:33.933
These guys are all morons, all right.
No wonder they're working for Ryoko.

00:07:33.933 --> 00:07:35.835
But, Kiyone...

00:07:35.835 --> 00:07:40.206
Why do you suppose Ryoko
went back to being a space pirate?

00:07:40.206 --> 00:07:44.144
When we were all on
Earth, we had fun together.

00:07:44.144 --> 00:07:45.178
Mihoshi...

00:07:45.178 --> 00:07:47.881
Maybe it's because of Tenchi.

00:07:47.881 --> 00:07:53.520
Maybe something happened that
day Tenchi's school had its festival.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.588
And she left out of shock?

00:07:55.588 --> 00:08:00.026
It's true that after seeing the
way Ryoko's been running wild,

00:08:00.026 --> 00:08:04.197
I get the feeling that her space
pirate nature is back in full force.

00:08:04.197 --> 00:08:08.067
But if she's acting that way because
of something that happened with Tenchi...

00:08:08.067 --> 00:08:09.669
Poor Ryoko...

00:08:09.669 --> 00:08:11.104
Mihoshi...

00:08:11.104 --> 00:08:16.509
Isn't there anything we can do?
I mean, we are Ryoko's friends...

00:08:16.509 --> 00:08:18.511
Maybe there's hope for reform...

00:08:18.511 --> 00:08:21.080
All right. Let's just see how things go.

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.750
Great! Kiyone, you're the best!

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:24.684
Hey! Mihoshi!

00:08:24.684 --> 00:08:28.521
Hey, you two new guys.

00:08:28.521 --> 00:08:30.256
You two...

00:08:30.256 --> 00:08:33.259
Oh, no! Did she recognize us?

00:08:33.259 --> 00:08:35.695
You're serving the gang, right?

00:08:35.695 --> 00:08:39.365
You've got guts, slacking
off from waiting the tables.

00:08:39.365 --> 00:08:41.334
Yes, Ma'am! We're told that a lot!

00:08:41.334 --> 00:08:42.669
I'm sorry!

00:08:42.669 --> 00:08:45.138
As your punishment, you're
gonna clean the entire hideout!

00:08:45.138 --> 00:08:46.840
Huh? But that's too harsh, Ryo...

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:49.676
Understood!

00:08:49.676 --> 00:08:52.011
Ryoko, those two people just now...

00:08:52.011 --> 00:08:54.080
Just as I was getting bored.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:56.983
I'm gonna have some fun with 'em.

00:08:56.983 --> 00:08:59.451
Give it your best shot, Kiyone, Mihoshi...

00:09:02.422 --> 00:09:04.090
She's just picking on us!

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:06.426
Better this that having her
find out who we really are!

00:09:06.426 --> 00:09:10.726
Hey! If you keep dawdling,
you're gonna wind up full of holes!

00:09:13.199 --> 00:09:14.434
What's the big idea?!

00:09:14.434 --> 00:09:16.493
She's picking on us, all right!

00:09:18.638 --> 00:09:21.841
So, who's gonna be skewered first?

00:09:21.841 --> 00:09:23.775
It's a dead end!

00:09:27.247 --> 00:09:30.546
Next, you're gonna make today's main dish.

00:09:32.485 --> 00:09:36.422
Okay, the ingredient for the
dish that I want you two to make

00:09:36.422 --> 00:09:38.014
is right here!

00:09:43.529 --> 00:09:46.828
Try not to get eaten by
the main ingredient, okay?

00:09:51.437 --> 00:09:55.999
Next up is laundry! I want
you to wash everyone's clothes!

00:10:05.618 --> 00:10:08.121
I'm getting dizzy!

00:10:08.121 --> 00:10:11.157
Okay! Next up is dinner entertainment!

00:10:11.157 --> 00:10:14.560
- Hi! We're the new recruits!
- Hi! We're the new recruits!

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.664
A while ago, I saw a planet
that had a ring spinning around it!

00:10:17.664 --> 00:10:19.766
Wheelie?

00:10:19.766 --> 00:10:23.536
- That sure threw 'em for a hoop!
- That sure threw 'em for a hoop!

00:10:23.536 --> 00:10:27.573
Ow! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:10:27.573 --> 00:10:29.609
- Plate spinning!
- Plate spinning!

00:10:29.609 --> 00:10:31.634
Ow! Ow!

00:10:33.613 --> 00:10:35.843
- Tightrope walking!
- Tightrope walking!

00:10:38.017 --> 00:10:40.383
- Jump through the hoop!
- Yes, Ma'am!

00:10:42.488 --> 00:10:45.725
All right, if it's come to
this, I'm gonna breathe fire!

00:10:45.725 --> 00:10:46.926
Can you do that?

00:10:46.926 --> 00:10:48.791
I have to!

00:10:51.264 --> 00:10:53.027
They like it!

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.703
This is hilarious! This is too funny!

00:10:56.703 --> 00:10:58.938
Kiyone! They really like it!

00:10:58.938 --> 00:11:00.735
L-I'm burned alive...

00:11:03.509 --> 00:11:05.578
Those two haven't changed a bit.

00:11:05.578 --> 00:11:07.347
Are you okay, Kiyone?

00:11:07.347 --> 00:11:11.150
It's no big deal. This will earn us a promotion.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:14.620
But Ryoko doesn't have
any hope of reforming at all!

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:17.957
Like I thought, the space
pirate in her has come back.

00:11:17.957 --> 00:11:21.361
That's not true. When Ryoko laughed,

00:11:21.361 --> 00:11:24.364
she looked just like she did
when she laughed on Earth.

00:11:24.364 --> 00:11:27.731
It just looked like somebody
laughing themselves sick to me.

00:11:46.452 --> 00:11:48.221
Here you go, Ryoko.

00:11:48.221 --> 00:11:49.745
Thanks.

00:11:50.757 --> 00:11:52.492
It's been a while.

00:11:52.492 --> 00:11:53.292
It sure has.

00:11:53.292 --> 00:11:55.762
Here, Kiyone.

00:11:55.762 --> 00:11:58.731
What're you doing, Mihoshi?!
I've got burns there!

00:11:58.731 --> 00:12:00.767
I'm sorry!

00:12:00.767 --> 00:12:02.602
You two are the greatest.

00:12:02.602 --> 00:12:04.504
So, how long have you known?

00:12:04.504 --> 00:12:07.439
Huh? How long?

00:12:08.608 --> 00:12:11.677
All right, this is my first job
having a gang along with me!

00:12:11.677 --> 00:12:13.702
You'd better keep up!

00:12:16.716 --> 00:12:17.917
Since then.

00:12:17.917 --> 00:12:19.218
Since that first job?

00:12:19.218 --> 00:12:21.083
She saw right through us, didn't she?

00:12:24.257 --> 00:12:26.726
Anyway, stay here
until those wounds heal.

00:12:26.726 --> 00:12:28.561
Really?

00:12:28.561 --> 00:12:31.297
This is just as relaxing as being on Earth!

00:12:31.297 --> 00:12:35.535
It sure is. This room was
my idea. I had Hotsuma build it.

00:12:35.535 --> 00:12:37.336
Right, Hotsuma?

00:12:37.336 --> 00:12:39.472
Hotsuma? Where'd he go?

00:12:39.472 --> 00:12:41.474
Hotsuma! Hey!

00:12:41.474 --> 00:12:45.344
Oh, well, anyway, this is my
room, so just kick back and relax.

00:12:45.344 --> 00:12:47.346
Isn't this great, Kiyone?

00:12:47.346 --> 00:12:49.348
Ryoko, why are you doing this?

00:12:49.348 --> 00:12:53.653
Why? I saw some familiar faces,
so I felt like teasing you guys.

00:12:53.653 --> 00:12:55.021
That's not what I meant.

00:12:55.021 --> 00:12:59.459
Anyway, I had no idea you could breathe fire!

00:12:59.459 --> 00:13:01.894
It was part of a magic trick
set that Washu gave to me!

00:13:01.894 --> 00:13:04.564
When did you...

00:13:04.564 --> 00:13:09.235
No! Why did you go back to
being Ryoko the space pirate?!

00:13:09.235 --> 00:13:10.470
What're you talking about?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:14.073
I didn't go back.
I've always been a space pirate.

00:13:14.073 --> 00:13:17.176
Then why did you pick now to leave Earth?

00:13:17.176 --> 00:13:19.245
That's none of your business.

00:13:19.245 --> 00:13:22.381
Something happened that day,
right? Something with Tenchi.

00:13:22.381 --> 00:13:24.183
What do you mean, "that day"?

00:13:24.183 --> 00:13:26.686
So that day is the cause of all this, then.

00:13:26.686 --> 00:13:29.188
I'm asking what day?

00:13:29.188 --> 00:13:32.959
The day Tenchi's school
had its school festival.

00:13:32.959 --> 00:13:34.660
That's got nothing to do with it.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:38.664
Looks like even space pirates are bad liars.

00:13:38.664 --> 00:13:40.199
Are you trying to pick a fight?

00:13:40.199 --> 00:13:42.168
What happened between you and Tenchi?

00:13:42.168 --> 00:13:43.569
Ryoko!

00:13:43.569 --> 00:13:45.638
Wh-What's your problem, Mihoshi?

00:13:45.638 --> 00:13:48.441
Where's the bathroom?

00:13:48.441 --> 00:13:51.210
There isn't a bathroom in this room!

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:52.812
It's next to the banquet hall.

00:13:52.812 --> 00:13:55.081
Got it!

00:13:55.081 --> 00:13:58.284
I've gotta hurry!

00:13:58.284 --> 00:14:02.655
There's a big line!

00:14:02.655 --> 00:14:05.091
What am I gonna...

00:14:05.091 --> 00:14:07.793
I'll do it. I'll breathe on 'em.

00:14:07.793 --> 00:14:11.092
Fire!

00:14:17.436 --> 00:14:19.005
Pardon me!

00:14:19.005 --> 00:14:21.340
To get onto another subject...

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.576
Why are you with that guy?

00:14:23.576 --> 00:14:24.844
What's it to you?

00:14:24.844 --> 00:14:28.781
I'm back! That was a close call!

00:14:28.781 --> 00:14:31.984
He'll never hold a candle to
Tenchi, no matter what he does.

00:14:31.984 --> 00:14:34.487
Tenchi isn't the only man alive.

00:14:34.487 --> 00:14:35.655
Are you serious?

00:14:35.655 --> 00:14:37.323
Yeah, I'm serious.

00:14:37.323 --> 00:14:40.893
Maybe I'll take him, then.

00:14:40.893 --> 00:14:43.930
Kiyone, you're so forward!

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:46.098
That doesn't sound like you at all.

00:14:46.098 --> 00:14:50.937
Well, I think an upright woman
like myself is more his type.

00:14:50.937 --> 00:14:54.040
A lady with a burnt ass
shouldn't be talking big.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:58.568
Besides, you're too late. That day,
Tenchi and that Sakuya girl were...

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:06.185
This isn't like you at all,
spilling the beans so easily...

00:15:06.185 --> 00:15:10.756
So, something happened between
Tenchi and Sakuya at the school festival.

00:15:10.756 --> 00:15:13.726
That's what made you leave Earth.

00:15:13.726 --> 00:15:16.429
Shut up! You've been babbling
like some big shot since you got here!

00:15:16.429 --> 00:15:19.665
I don't care about Earth anymore!
I've forgotten all about it!

00:15:19.665 --> 00:15:22.668
You've forgotten about Earth?
Don't make me laugh.

00:15:22.668 --> 00:15:26.331
This room is exactly like the
living room at the Masaki house!

00:15:31.978 --> 00:15:35.971
Think about it carefully.
What do you really want?

00:15:39.385 --> 00:15:40.253
Ryoko!

00:15:40.253 --> 00:15:41.654
Ryoko...

00:15:41.654 --> 00:15:44.590
What I really want?

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:46.792
If I knew that, it wouldn't be so hard.

00:15:46.792 --> 00:15:49.228
I think it's the same with everyone.

00:15:49.228 --> 00:15:51.197
Do you really plan to stay a space pirate?

00:15:51.197 --> 00:15:54.934
I can't go back to the way
things were. That much is obvious.

00:15:54.934 --> 00:15:57.236
I don't think you've changed that much.

00:15:57.236 --> 00:15:58.371
Really?

00:15:58.371 --> 00:15:59.338
Yeah!

00:15:59.338 --> 00:16:01.874
Come on, Ryoko, let's play cards!

00:16:01.874 --> 00:16:04.843
What're you doing with a deck of cards?

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:10.249
All right! Let's play a hand!

00:16:10.249 --> 00:16:15.915
I can't let Ryoko and those
Galaxy Police become friends again.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:20.359
Captain, we've received an anonymous tip.

00:16:20.359 --> 00:16:24.997
It says that Ryoko the space
pirate is holed up at point 2-0-0.

00:16:24.997 --> 00:16:29.035
That's where Detectives Special Grade
Mihoshi and Kiyone went undercover.

00:16:29.035 --> 00:16:32.732
All right, make for
point 2-0-0 at flank speed!

00:16:34.473 --> 00:16:38.377
Anyway, why did you two come here?

00:16:38.377 --> 00:16:41.213
Uncover Ryoko the space pirate's hideout,

00:16:41.213 --> 00:16:43.816
contact the Special Investigations
Department at Galaxy Police HQ,

00:16:43.816 --> 00:16:47.853
and keep you here until they arrive.

00:16:47.853 --> 00:16:51.254
That was the mission, anyway,
but you can see how that worked out.

00:16:52.692 --> 00:16:58.264
With that butt of yours,
you can't slow me down.

00:16:58.264 --> 00:17:02.101
But I won't let you
be a pirate again. Got it?

00:17:02.101 --> 00:17:03.602
If you think you can stop me,
give it your best shot.

00:17:03.602 --> 00:17:06.038
Aren't friends great?

00:17:06.038 --> 00:17:10.634
Even if you go your separate ways,
you can pick up where you left off.

00:17:17.216 --> 00:17:18.517
What's that?

00:17:18.517 --> 00:17:19.585
Ryoko!

00:17:19.585 --> 00:17:20.786
What's going on, Hotsuma?

00:17:20.786 --> 00:17:23.589
Ryoko! It's the Galaxy Police!

00:17:23.589 --> 00:17:26.292
Oh, you mean these two? It's okay.

00:17:26.292 --> 00:17:28.260
No, look!

00:17:30.429 --> 00:17:33.933
It's the Special Investigations
Division's new fleet!

00:17:33.933 --> 00:17:38.504
This is the Galaxy Police.
Space pirate Ryoko, there's no escape.

00:17:38.504 --> 00:17:40.699
Surrender peacefully!

00:17:41.774 --> 00:17:43.809
Huh?

00:17:43.809 --> 00:17:46.479
Respond, Detectives
Special Grade Mihoshi and Kiyone!

00:17:46.479 --> 00:17:48.881
This is Special Investigations!
Well done, you two!

00:17:48.881 --> 00:17:51.717
Leave the rest to us! Over!

00:17:51.717 --> 00:17:53.018
What's going on?

00:17:53.018 --> 00:17:54.542
Good question.

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.489
So that's it...

00:17:56.489 --> 00:17:57.556
Wait, we didn't...

00:17:57.556 --> 00:17:59.024
Shut up!

00:17:59.024 --> 00:18:01.327
"Friends," huh?

00:18:01.327 --> 00:18:04.497
Now I know what I really want.

00:18:04.497 --> 00:18:06.365
I won't listen to what
anybody says anymore.

00:18:06.365 --> 00:18:08.968
I'm gonna do what I want
and run wild through space!

00:18:08.968 --> 00:18:11.604
You've got it all wrong! It wasn't us!

00:18:11.604 --> 00:18:13.205
Let's go, Ryoko.

00:18:13.205 --> 00:18:14.173
Yeah.

00:18:14.173 --> 00:18:15.441
Ryoko...

00:18:15.441 --> 00:18:18.711
Ryoko! What about Tenchi?

00:18:18.711 --> 00:18:21.547
You aren't interested in going
back to your life on Earth, then?

00:18:21.547 --> 00:18:23.048
I don't care anymore.

00:18:23.048 --> 00:18:24.583
Hurry, Ryoko!

00:18:24.583 --> 00:18:26.385
Ryoko!

00:18:26.385 --> 00:18:28.354
Kiyone, aren't we gonna go after her?

00:18:28.354 --> 00:18:30.723
I can't, not with this wound.
It's up to you, Mihoshi.

00:18:30.723 --> 00:18:32.247
Got it!

00:18:34.593 --> 00:18:38.063
Understand? The Galaxy Police
are nothing to be afraid of.

00:18:38.063 --> 00:18:41.100
Guard this hideout with your lives.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:44.069
Ryoko!

00:18:44.069 --> 00:18:45.838
Don't go!

00:18:45.838 --> 00:18:49.508
Come back to Earth with us!

00:18:49.508 --> 00:18:50.376
Mihoshi...

00:18:50.376 --> 00:18:53.279
Okay? Let's go back, Ryoko!

00:18:53.279 --> 00:18:55.873
Don't let her come aboard the ship!

00:19:05.057 --> 00:19:06.892
P-Please stop!

00:19:06.892 --> 00:19:08.761
If you don't stop, I'll do it!

00:19:08.761 --> 00:19:10.490
I'll do it!

00:19:12.097 --> 00:19:14.190
I'll breathe fire!

00:19:15.601 --> 00:19:18.092
Fire!

00:19:20.372 --> 00:19:24.069
Freeze! If you move, I'll barbecue you!

00:19:28.914 --> 00:19:30.677
Ryoko...

00:19:42.127 --> 00:19:45.426
Those jerks... They made me remember.

00:19:48.801 --> 00:19:53.539
You plug this into this
formula here, and you get this.

00:19:53.539 --> 00:19:56.008
Oh, okay. I made a stupid mistake.

00:19:56.008 --> 00:19:57.676
That's my Tenchi!

00:19:57.676 --> 00:20:02.214
Enough with the "gifted couple" talk.
See what you can do with him.

00:20:02.214 --> 00:20:04.650
Zero wins, eight losses...
Three makeup exams!

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:06.619
Do something, Masaki!

00:20:06.619 --> 00:20:10.456
At this rate, his vacation's gonna be
nothing but supplementary lessons.

00:20:10.456 --> 00:20:14.660
No! I wanna go on a trip with everybody!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.495
All right, all right...

00:20:16.495 --> 00:20:18.397
Masaki's amazing.

00:20:18.397 --> 00:20:21.734
Yeah, his explanations are
really easy to understand.

00:20:21.734 --> 00:20:24.603
He's helping out Amagasaki,
just like he said he would.

00:20:24.603 --> 00:20:27.840
And at the school festival, we
could count on him for everything.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.341
You're so lucky, Sakuya...

00:20:29.341 --> 00:20:31.944
Matsuno, don't tell you
have a thing for Masaki!

00:20:31.944 --> 00:20:34.914
No! No! That's not how I meant it!

00:20:34.914 --> 00:20:36.048
I just...

00:20:36.048 --> 00:20:37.716
Tenchi's amazing!

00:20:37.716 --> 00:20:42.346
I want to get to know him better!
I want to know everything about him!

00:20:43.756 --> 00:20:45.958
Matori. Tsugaru.

00:20:45.958 --> 00:20:48.984
I really don't understand
this girl's feelings...

00:21:01.674 --> 00:21:04.006
Don't get any closer.

00:21:36.342 --> 00:21:39.945
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.945 --> 00:21:43.849
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.849 --> 00:21:47.453
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.453 --> 00:21:51.390
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:54.893
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.893 --> 00:21:58.864
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.864 --> 00:22:02.201
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:02.201 --> 00:22:06.205
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:06.205 --> 00:22:08.340
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:10.275
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.275 --> 00:22:11.777
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.777 --> 00:22:17.616
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.616 --> 00:22:21.720
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:24.990
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:28.527
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.527 --> 00:22:33.226
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:43.242 --> 00:22:44.777
Mihoshi here!

00:22:44.777 --> 00:22:49.114
Our everyday conduct is good,
so we're finally getting a medal!

00:22:49.114 --> 00:22:52.751
I bet Tenchi's gonna
be happy when he hears!

00:22:52.751 --> 00:22:56.889
Come to think of it, it's the season
on Earth when the cicadas are buzzing...

00:22:56.889 --> 00:23:01.026
Hey, Kiyone, don't we
get a summer vacation?

00:23:01.026 --> 00:23:04.663
If we do, I wanna go see Tenchi!

00:23:04.663 --> 00:23:10.533
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"Real Friends?"
